      proof: The kitchen area is behind the camera and the hallway ahead fills the view.
  [3] Go to the end of the hallway
      proof: The archway near the painting is directly ahead of the camera, within a step.
  [4] Wait in the archway near the painting
      proof: The camera is stopped beside the archway and the painting is centred in the view
